Package: cosmoe
Architecture: any
Depends:
 adwaita-icon-theme,
 xcursor-themes,
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: BeOS-compatible C++ application framework
 Cosmoe is a C++ library for building rich applications with the BeOS API
 across Linux, macOS, Windows, and Haiku.
 .
 This package contains Cosmoe's shared libraries, runtime add-ons, and
 supporting data files.

Package: cosmoe-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends:
 cosmoe (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: development files for the Cosmoe framework
 This package contains the C++ headers, static libraries, resource compiler,
 and command-line development tools required to build applications against
 Cosmoe.

Package: cosmoe-apps
Section: x11
Architecture: any
Depends:
 cosmoe (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: applications bundled with the Cosmoe framework
 This package contains the sample applications, desktop integrations, and
 command-line tools bundled with the Cosmoe framework.
